      "id": "sol.ahsme-1966-p13.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "For example, set \\(y=1.\\) Every positive rational \\(x\\leq4\\) then gives an allowed point \\((x,1),\\) and there are infinitely many such rationals.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is E.",
